st; 500 random 50/50 calibration/holdout splits. loo corr 0.1998, auc 0.5986; holdout additive embed'\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-PAP-033\n- observed_method: 296 movers (230 with outcomes); LOO travel forecast; 500 random 50/50 calibration/holdout splits."}, {"id": "FAM:SF32", "score": 0.081, "document": "# FAM:SF32 | Study family SF32: Opener recommendations vs personnel feasibility\n- observed_research_question: Opener recommendations vs personnel feasibility\n- auto_outcome_status: artifact\n- observed_hypothesis: Rank-1 openers are within what the top-8 rotation can sustain.\n- observed_result: [APPA-033] 8/8 rank-1 openers CUT-centered and INFEASIBLE; worst gaps +9.6 to +15.9pp; CUT target 14-18% vs ceiling 2-6%.\n- observed_result: [APPM-025] All 24 openers seeded by CUT/PUTBACK/TRANSITION/PNR; CUT target exceeds stretch ceiling by +9.6 to +15.9pp for every team (e.g. PHI capacity 1.7% vs target 16.4%).\n- auto_failure_mechanism: C_artifact (apparent effect produced by a construction, selection or labelling flaw)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:small_sample\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:BASE_RATE\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:DRIFT_NONSTATIONARITY\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER\n- observed_failure_evidence: [APPA-033] Optimizer ignores personnel; CUT target 3-10x stretch ceiling in every team-game.\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF11"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPA-052", "score": 0.077, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPA-052 | Study family SF-APPA-052: CUT feasibility cap: BEST-AVOID gap without CUT-heavy games\n- observed_research_question: CUT feasibility cap: BEST-AVOID gap without CUT-heavy games\n- auto_outcome_status: supported\n- observed_hypothesis: The BEST vs AVOID gap is inflated by games where CUT exceeds 15% of H2 mix.\n- observed_result: All games BEST 1.473 vs AVOID 0.853 gap +0.620 MW p=0.0000 Spearman -0.316 n=2,544. CUT<=15%: +0.625 n=2,508. CUT>15%: +0.163 n.s. n=36. Only 4/272 games had CUT>15%.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: D_positive (no failure: positive result)\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:BASE_RATE\n- observed_failure_evidence: Removing the 4 CUT-heavy games slightly strengthens the gap (+0.620 to +0.625).\n- observed_sample_and_power: 2,544 rows; 272 games\n- auto_validation_status: same_pipeline_validation; evidence: APPA-052: 'tale relative to n-gated +0.375 / best-vs-continue +0.445). robustness direction still holds on this csv. 2,544 rows; 272 game'\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF32\n- observed_verdict: supported\n- auto_confidence: high (1.0)"}], "n_results": 4}

