    {
      "id": "FAM:SF-PAP-033",
      "status_as_recorded": "supported",
      "finding": "Additive > irrelevant on destination embedded minutes and on-court net rating survives when travel OLS and medians are fit on a calibration half and scored on holdout (500 splits; embedded-rate gap P(>0)=0.838; net-rtg gap P(>0)=0.960)."
