      "FAM:SF-APPA-052",
      "FAM:SF-APPS-088"
    ],
    "summary": "Earlier work established the travel x fit framework for role portability and found that shapers exist as a distinct structural role. It also showed that cut-heavy team mixes are infeasible and extremely sparse. However, no prior study directly tested whether the play-type composition (cut vs drive) of a shaper predicts how well their role travels."
